      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "text": "\u2022 Mic Audio (Mono 16 kHz)\n\u2022 DeepFilterNet Denoising\n\u2022 NeMo IndicConformer CTC\n\u2022 Aggregate Tokenizer (bn)\n\u2022 Streaming Output:\n  '\u09a4\u09c1\u09ae\u09bf \u0995\u09be\u09b2 \u0995\u09c7\u09a8 \u0986\u09b8\u09cb\u09a8\u09bf?'\n\u23f1\ufe0f Latency: ~180 ms",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 Mic Audio (Mono 16 kHz)\n\u2022 DeepFilterNet Denoising\n\u2022 NeMo IndicConformer CTC\n\u2022 Aggregate Tokenizer (bn)\n\u2022 Streaming Output:\n  '\u09a4\u09c1\u09ae\u09bf \u0995\u09be\u09b2 \u0995\u09c7\u09a8 \u0986\u09b8\u09cb\u09a8\u09bf?'\n\u23f1\ufe0f Latency: ~180 ms"
