      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "text": "\u2022 Gemini 2.5 Flash / Local LLM\n\u2022 System Directive:\n  Inject semantic tags:\n  [warm], [excited], [whisper],\n  [serious], [inquisitive]\n\u2022 Output Stream:\n  '[warm] \u0995\u09be\u09b2 \u09b6\u09b0\u09c0\u09b0\u099f\u09be \u0996\u09be\u09b0\u09be\u09aa \u099b\u09bf\u09b2...'\n\u23f1\ufe0f Time-to-First-Token: ~220 ms",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 Gemini 2.5 Flash / Local LLM\n\u2022 System Directive:\n  Inject semantic tags:\n  [warm], [excited], [whisper],\n  [serious], [inquisitive]\n\u2022 Output Stream:\n  '[warm] \u0995\u09be\u09b2 \u09b6\u09b0\u09c0\u09b0\u099f\u09be \u0996\u09be\u09b0\u09be\u09aa \u099b\u09bf\u09b2...'\n\u23f1\ufe0f Time-to-First-Token: ~220 ms"
