      "updated": 1,
      "text": "\u2022 BengaliTextNormalizer\n  NFC, Digits '\u09e6-\u09ef' -> words\n\u2022 BengaliPhonemizer (IPA)\n  Juktakkhor conjunct split\n  Inherent vowel & virama\n\u2022 BengaliPhonemeTokenizer\n  Maps IPA -> Token IDs",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 BengaliTextNormalizer\n  NFC, Digits '\u09e6-\u09ef' -> words\n\u2022 BengaliPhonemizer (IPA)\n  Juktakkhor conjunct split\n  Inherent vowel & virama\n\u2022 BengaliPhonemeTokenizer\n  Maps IPA -> Token IDs"
    },
