      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "text": "\u2022 Curated 'style_bank.pt'\n\u2022 Jeet Acoustic Latents (64-d)\n  [neutral, warm, excited,\n   whisper, serious, inquisitive]\n\u2022 Style Blending / Interpolation:\n  s = \u03b1 * s_A + (1-\u03b1) * s_B\n\u2022 Modulates F0 & energy",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 Curated 'style_bank.pt'\n\u2022 Jeet Acoustic Latents (64-d)\n  [neutral, warm, excited,\n   whisper, serious, inquisitive]\n\u2022 Style Blending / Interpolation:\n  s = \u03b1 * s_A + (1-\u03b1) * s_B\n\u2022 Modulates F0 & energy"
    },
