      "updated": 1,
      "text": "\u2022 Timbre: Jeet Voice Weights\n\u2022 Prosody & Duration Predictor\n  (GRU: Style vector -> F0 contour)\n\u2022 Text / Phoneme Encoder\n\u2022 Single-Pass AdaIN Generator\n\u2022 Vocos Neural Vocoder (24 kHz)\n\u26a1 RTF < 0.1 (~250ms total)\n\ud83d\udcbe VRAM: ~1.7 GB (RTX 2050 safe)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 Timbre: Jeet Voice Weights\n\u2022 Prosody & Duration Predictor\n  (GRU: Style vector -> F0 contour)\n\u2022 Text / Phoneme Encoder\n\u2022 Single-Pass AdaIN Generator\n\u2022 Vocos Neural Vocoder (24 kHz)\n\u26a1 RTF < 0.1 (~250ms total)\n\ud83d\udcbe VRAM: ~1.7 GB (RTX 2050 safe)"
