      "text": "\u2022 Peak Attenuation (-1 dB)\n\u2022 Dual Format Export:\n  - 24 kHz Hi-Fi (User play)\n  - 16 kHz (Resampled)\n\u2022 Chained Audio Stream\n\u2022 Browser Web Audio API\n\ud83c\udfaf End-to-End Latency: < 600 ms",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 Peak Attenuation (-1 dB)\n\u2022 Dual Format Export:\n  - 24 kHz Hi-Fi (User play)\n  - 16 kHz (Resampled)\n\u2022 Chained Audio Stream\n\u2022 Browser Web Audio API\n\ud83c\udfaf End-to-End Latency: < 600 ms"
    },
