      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "text": "\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Offline Training & Identity Calibration (Kaggle T4 / Local GPU)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Offline Training & Identity Calibration (Kaggle T4 / Local GPU)"
    },
    {
      "id": "bottom_training_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 395,
      "y": 495,
      "width": 890,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 308496,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "text": "1. Foundational Voice Timbre: 80 Accepted Jeet Voice Takes (~500s clean speech from voice_users/jeet/)\n2. Emotion Calibration Set: 30-40 Takes across emotion states (Warm, Excited, Whisper, Serious, Inquisitive)\n3. Acoustic Style Encoder: Maps reference audio spectrograms -> 64-dim style embeddings into 'style_bank.pt'\n4. Decoupled Adaptation: Freeze phoneme encoder; fine-tune AdaIN decoder layers with adversarial loss.\nOutcome: Jeet's authentic vocal chords with dynamic LLM-steered emotional range!",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Foundational Voice Timbre: 80 Accepted Jeet Voice Takes (~500s clean speech from voice_users/jeet/)\n2. Emotion Calibration Set: 30-40 Takes across emotion states (Warm, Excited, Whisper, Serious, Inquisitive)\n3. Acoustic Style Encoder: Maps reference audio spectrograms -> 64-dim style embeddings into 'style_bank.pt'\n4. Decoupled Adaptation: Freeze phoneme encoder; fine-tune AdaIN decoder layers with adversarial loss.\nOutcome: Jeet's authentic vocal chords with dynamic LLM-steered emotional range!"
    },
